title trim page time ruler at the very start (marker 0:00, ZOOM 60 s): the window reaches 30 s before the take; the ticks before it have no label, "0:00" sits under the marker, every label inside the panel
sizes 720x720
ppmm 800
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_PAGE trim
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1
env CASSETTE_DEMO_TRIM_MARKER 0

wait 600
shot ruler-zero
expect text "ZOOM"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
